msgid "A rule selects one DNS profile. Each profile owns one SmartDNS instance. Its upstream connections are router-local traffic and use the same ordinary Rules as every other local connection."
msgstr "每条规则选择一个 DNS 配置。每个配置对应一个 SmartDNS 实例，其上游连接属于路由器本机流量，与其他本机连接一样使用普通规则。"

