msgid "Create a proxy node before adding a single-node route."
msgstr "请先创建代理节点，再添加单节点路由。"

msgid "Create named SOCKS, HTTP or mixed entry points. An entry point does not own a node: ordered rules choose its DNS profile and route, just like transparent traffic. Existing service ports are not imported automatically."
msgstr "创建具名的 SOCKS、HTTP 或混合入口。入口不绑定节点：与透明代理流量一样，由有序规则选择 DNS 配置和路由。现有服务端口不会自动导入。"

