msgstr "节点"

msgid "Nodes & Routes"
msgstr "节点与路由"

msgid "Nodes describe transport credentials. Rules never point at a node directly; they point at a named route so subscriptions and failover can evolve without rewriting policy."
msgstr "节点描述传输凭据。规则从不直接指向节点，而是指向具名路由，因此订阅和故障转移可以独立演进，无需重写策略。"

msgid "Non-globally-reachable and local destinations bypass Steer before user rules. Router-originated UDP NTP on port 123 always goes direct so time synchronization cannot depend on the proxy core. Traditional DNS on port 53 is intercepted first when router traffic proxying is enabled."
msgstr "非全球可达地址和本地目标会在用户规则之前绕过 Steer。路由器发起的 UDP/123 NTP 始终直连，避免时间同步依赖代理核心。启用路由器本机代理后，传统的 53 端口 DNS 会被优先拦截。"

