msgid "Only traffic entering these zones is managed. Other zones, including WAN unless explicitly selected, are untouched."
msgstr "仅管理从这些区域进入的流量。其他区域不会被改动；WAN 也只有在明确选择后才会纳入管理。"

msgid "Optionally limit this rule to one or more user-created local proxy endpoints. SmartDNS upstream connections are router traffic and use these same ordered rules."
msgstr "可选择将此规则限制到一个或多个用户创建的本地代理入口。SmartDNS 上游连接属于路由器流量，使用同一组有序规则。"

