msgid "The startup root for proxy-node and encrypted-DNS hostnames. It is always contacted directly by IP with the core bypass mark, so startup never depends on SmartDNS or a proxy node."
msgstr "用于解析代理节点和加密 DNS 主机名的启动根。它始终以 IP 直连并带有核心绕行标记，因此启动过程不会依赖 SmartDNS 或代理节点。"

msgid "This mark only prevents SmartDNS UDP/TCP 53 upstream packets from being captured as new local DNS queries. The packets still enter TPROXY and use ordinary Rules. It must not overlap the TPROXY mark mask."
msgstr "此标记只防止 SmartDNS 的 UDP/TCP 53 上游数据包再次被捕获为新的本地 DNS 查询。这些数据包仍会进入 TPROXY 并使用普通规则。该标记不得与 TPROXY 标记掩码重叠。"

msgid "Traffic steering"
msgstr "流量分流"

msgid "Traffic steering is active"
msgstr "流量分流已启用"

msgid "Traffic steering is not fully active"
msgstr "流量分流尚未完全启用"

msgid "UDP packet encoding"
msgstr "UDP 数据包编码"

